                <mxCell id="66" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Initial Backend Code Generation Prompt&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;I want to create a&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;FastAPI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;backend to do company background check.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;The backend would receive either the company_name or registration_number (or both) and then using the provided data it should do a number of search online (e.g., company establishment and filing history, directors search, media coverage search, scam coverage search, etc).&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is the example input for the backend API:&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;{&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;company_name&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;Acme Consulting Ltd&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;registration_number&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;&quot;12345678&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;jurisdiction&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;&quot;GB&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;These search module should be modular (i.e., it should be easily extensible should we want to add more search module later in the future). The search module should rely on publicly available APIs or online search normally and the output would be parsed by an LLM to fit a specific JSON schema. For the LLM I&#39;m going to use OpenRouter API.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For the jurisdiction information on the input, this would be used to determine which search modules are used. Each of the search module can either be jurisdictions specific (only applies to a list of countries) or can be used on all jurisdictions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Each of the different searches should run in parallel as they mostly would be I/O heavy. The background check should also run asynchronously and for each requests the user did, the backend should return the job_id to track the progress and get the results. For the progress, we want the backend to expose what search has been completed, what is currently on going, and what is still pending.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;An example output JSON can be something like as follows but feel free to add more information on it:&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;{&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;company_name&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;Acme Consulting Ltd&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;registration_number&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;&quot;12345678&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;jurisdiction&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;&quot;GB&quot;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;search_results&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;[...]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot; class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(133, 0, 67);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;search_conclusion&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(135, 91, 44);&quot; class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; class=&quot;s3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 138, 3);&quot; class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;&#39;...&#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; margin: 0px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135);&quot; class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Make sure the code is clean and structured with clear separation of concern. Also, please make sure the Swagger UI is clear for manual testing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1090" y="-20" width="370" height="930" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
